## Verify Your Installation

Follow the directions in the main [README](../../README.md) to install `volumito`.

If the installation went well, you should be able to run the `version` command,
printing the version of the `volumito` tool itself:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito version
```

Check that you can connect to the Volumio host by issuing the `info` command:

```bash lucio command=execute
volumito --host volumio.local info
```

where `volumio.local` is the local name of the Volumio host.
(You can also use its IP address, if you know it.)
